# NOTE: admin/ is deployed on purpose — the shop owner works from it.
# The password is not in this bundle: it is an environment variable on the
# server and every write is re-checked there, so the panel shipping to the
# browser gives an attacker nothing.
#
# api/ is NOT listed here. It is the backend, and Vercel turns each file in it
# into a function — except anything under api/_lib, which is skipped for
# routing because the name begins with an underscore.

# Source photos. hero_bg_shop.png and the gallery are copied into assets/,
# which is what the site actually loads.
photo susex/

# Node-only checks for the booking rules; the browser never loads them.
tests/

# Run by hand, once, from a laptop. Nothing serves them.
db/
scripts/
MIGRATION.md
